flowchart TD
    title Order Tracking Flow

    A[View Order History] --> B[Load User Orders]
    B --> C[Display Order List]
    C --> D{Select Order?}
    D -->|No| E[End]
    D -->|Yes| F[Load Order Details]
    F --> G[Load Order Items]
    G --> H{Has Tracking?}
    H -->|No| I[Show "Not Yet Shipped"]
    H -->|Yes| J[Call Shipping API]
    J --> K[Get Tracking Status]
    K --> L[Display Tracking Map]
    L --> M[Show Delivery ETA]
    M --> N{Status Update?}
    N -->|Yes| O[Update Status Display]
    O --> N
    N -->|No| P[End]
